{%- comment -%}
  SYNOR Diaries — YouTube, pan lazy.

  Shuru ma khali thumbnail ane ek vintage jevi kadi. YouTube nu koi script
  load thatu nathi; click kare tyare j iframe andar aave. Ek iframe ~1.5MB
  lai aave chhe ane page speed Google na ranking ma ganaay chhe.

  Chhapa na mijaj mate: kaadi sonery/shahi ni, kaagaj par — kaalu khanu nahi.
  Andar "▶ FILM" nu nishan, jem chhapa ma photo credit hoy.

  hqdefault.jpg vaapryu chhe, maxresdefault nahi — maxres badha video par
  hoti nathi ane tooti image dekhaay. hqdefault 480x360 chhe jema 16:9 frame
  vacche chhe, etle object-fit:cover thi kaali patti crop thai jaay.

  nocookie domain — visitor click na kare tya sudhi eni par kai nakhatu nathi.

  Vaapar: {% render 'sa-blog-video', id: 'dQw4w9WgXcQ', title: article.title %}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if id != blank -%}
  <div class="ncut ncut-film" data-yt="{{ id }}">
    <img class="ncut-th"
         src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/{{ id }}/hqdefault.jpg"
         alt="{{ title | default: 'Film' | escape }}"
         width="480" height="270" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    <button type="button" class="ncut-go" aria-label="Play film">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5z"/></svg>
    </button>
    <span class="ncut-mark">&#9654;&nbsp;Film</span>
    {%- if credit != blank -%}<span class="ncut-cr">{{ credit }}</span>{%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
